  <div id="sutta">
  
                <h3 id="AN5_137" class="h1">One Sleeps Little<br/>
                  Appaṁ Sutta  (AN 5:137)</h3><!--end suttahead-->
<p>“Monks, these five get little sleep at night, and are mostly awake. Which five? A woman intent on a man gets little sleep at night, and is mostly awake. A man intent on a woman gets little sleep at night, and is mostly awake. A thief intent on theft gets little sleep at night, and is mostly awake. A king fettered by royal duties gets little sleep at night, and is mostly awake. A monk intent on becoming unfettered gets little sleep at night, and is mostly awake. </p>
<p>“These five, monks, get little sleep at night, and are mostly awake.”</p>
<p class="seealso">See also: <a href="AN4_37.html" class="sutta-ref">AN 4:37</a>; <a href="../KN/Thag/thag1_84.html" class="sutta-ref">Thag 1:84</a>; <a href="../KN/Thag/thag2_37.html" class="sutta-ref">Thag 2:37</a></p>
